book-portable-name = Packed: { $name }
book-portable-taming-requirements = You need food in either hand, a living weakened beast (at least 20 damage), and room for a companion.
book-portable-taming-started = Hold the beast's attention for 30 seconds. Moving, taking damage, or choosing "Cancel taming" interrupts training and angers it.
book-portable-taming-cancelled = Training was interrupted. The beast is no longer holding back!
book-portable-taming-success = The beast accepts you as its master. You can now give it orders.

ent-MedievalBookPackedCrate = packed crate
    .desc = A crate secured for carrying, with all its contents. Activate it to unpack.
ent-MedievalBookPackedWorkbench = dismantled workbench
    .desc = A dismantled workbench. Its parts and materials make a heavy load. Activate it to assemble.
ent-MedievalBookPackedTrap = packed spike trap
    .desc = A safely dismantled spike trap. Activate it to install and arm it.
ent-MedievalBookPackedRoots = plant with wrapped roots
    .desc = A living plant packed with its soil and roots. Activate it to replant.
